      "releaseNotes": "Please watch the video and read the FAQ:\nhttp://www.CameraRemoteWatch.com/faq/\nThe \"Sync\" step, shown in the video, is very important. Don't skip it and make sure that the watch app Camera Remote Watch is closed during the Sync.",
      "version": "1.0.9",
